or why it ended. #: close_precheck aliases this same set.\tPASS\t60\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:ADMINISTRATIVE_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"duplicate\"\", \"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"superseded\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\"}):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:ADMINISTRATIVE_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"duplicate\"\", \"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"superseded\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\"}):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:ADMINISTRATIVE_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"duplicate\"\", \"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"superseded\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\"}):1\"\t#: Only these classes apply to non-bug tickets.\tPASS\t39\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REASON_REQUIRED_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\", \"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REASON_REQUIRED_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\", \"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REASON_REQUIRED_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"obsolete\"\", \"\"wontfix\"\", \"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t#: These classes require a recorded reason, except that not_a_bug and #: escalated may name a usable replacement instead.\tPASS\t102\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REPLACEMENT_SATISFIES_REASON_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REPLACEMENT_SATISFIES_REASON_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:REPLACEMENT_SATISFIES_REASON_CLASSES = frozenset({\"\"not_a_bug\"\", \"\"escalated\"\"}):1\"\t#: Prefer a usable replacement for these bug classes, then fall back to #: the reason. Obsolete and wontfix still require the stated reason.\tPASS\t119\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:def replacement_of(:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:def replacement_of(:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#C:<module>:before:def replacement_of(:1\t# replacement-walk-ok: Single owner of the duplicates and supersedes walk.\tPASS\t26\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:replacement_of\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:replacement_of\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:replacement_of\tFind a recorded or usable replacement for a ticket. Prefer its outbound duplicates link, then an inbound supersedes link. Both directions use net-active links, including snapshots. require_live filters either direction for a usable target. On unreadable subject state, stop for fail-closed usable-target checks or continue for remedy wording.\tPASS\t237\t48\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:find_replacement\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:find_replacement\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py#D:find_replacement\tReturn a usable replacement ID for a disposition class, or None. This checks disposition classes without ticket-type narrowing and fails closed on unreadable state.\tPASS\t81\t24\tPASS\tPASS\